#
# Find which field makes the RFC dump with CX_SY_CONVERSION_NO_NUMBER on POST Questionnaires_1Set.
#
# How to use in BAS (REST Client extension - humao.rest-client):
#   1. Run "0. CSRF token" first, then the tests ("Send Request" above each one)
#   2. Each test sends the minimum payload + ONE field. The test that returns 500 is the field the RFC cannot convert
#
# The host "<destination>.dest" is resolved by BAS with the destination of ui5.yaml (s4h_backend_cap),
# including its authentication. The public URL https://portXXXX-workspaces-...cloud.sap returns 401 here.
#
# Note: the requests that succeed create draft questionnaires (StatusQuest 01) in QAS.
#

@host = http://s4h_backend_cap.dest
@service = /sap/opu/odata/sap/ZGW_VETTING_SRV
@token = {{csrf.response.headers.x-csrf-token}}

### 0. CSRF token (run first)
# @name csrf
GET {{host}}{{service}}/
x-csrf-token: Fetch
Accept: application/json

### 1. Baseline: only the required fields (must return 201)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01" }

### 2. Quest17 - 1.7 Type of contract (ContractKindsSet)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01", "Quest17": "COA" }

### 3. Quest121 - 1.2 Terminal (PonPortosSet)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01", "Quest121": "A CORUNA" }

### 4. Quest15 - 1.5 Product (TpCargosSet)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01", "Quest15": "ACRYLONITRILE" }

### 5. Quest26 - 2.6 Hull and bottom configuration (HullTypesSet)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01", "Quest26": "DH" }

### 6. Quest131 - 1.3 Ports (typed)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01", "Quest131": "SP" }

### 7. Quest43A-D - 4.3 Nationality (typed)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01", "Quest43A": "sp", "Quest43B": "sp", "Quest43C": "sp", "Quest43D": "sp" }

### 8. Free text fields - 2.1 / 2.4 / 2.13
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{ "IdQuest": "000000", "StatusQuest": "01", "Quest21": "ADSA", "Quest24": "SASDA", "Quest213": "TESTE" }

### 9. Full payload sent by the app (reproduces the error)
POST {{host}}{{service}}/Questionnaires_1Set
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-csrf-token: {{token}}

{
